---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Muheeb Sulaiman — Digital Marketing Strategist & Founder"
  description="How Muheeb Sulaiman builds revenue systems across SEO, paid media, AI, and automation — and the ventures behind Correct Marketing NG and ChefDaddy Cuisine."
>
  <div class="about-hero section--sm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-hero__grid">
        <div>
          <div class="label">The Strategist</div>
          <div class="about-hero__name-block">
            <h1 class="about-hero__name">Muheeb<em>Sulaiman.</em></h1>
            <div class="about-hero__title">Digital Marketing Strategist · Founder · Business Operator</div>
          </div>
          <p class="about-hero__body">I'm a strategist, founder, and operator. I've spent the last 7+ years obsessed with one question: how do you build a business that grows predictably?<br><br>The answer, consistently, has been systems. Not more content. Not bigger ad budgets. Systems — the kind that compound, scale, and work even when you're not watching.<br><br>That's what I build. At Correct Marketing NG, for clients across Nigeria and globally, and through every venture I've started or operated.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact"><span>→ Work With Me</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="about-hero__img-block">
          <div class="about-hero__img-frame">
            <img src="/images/muheeb-sulaiman.jpg" alt="Portrait of Muheeb Sulaiman, founder of Correct Marketing NG" width="800" height="1200">
            <div class="about-hero__img-caption">Muheeb Sulaiman · Founder, Correct Marketing NG</div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-hero__accent"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="divider"></div>

  <section class="section about-philosophy" aria-label="Philosophy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-philosophy__grid">
        <div>
          <div class="label">Philosophy</div>
          <blockquote class="philosophy-quote">"Not just marketing — building revenue systems that scale businesses. The goal is never impressions. The goal is always outcomes."</blockquote>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="label">Timeline</div>
          <div class="about-timeline">
            <div class="timeline-item">
              <div class="timeline-item__year">2024</div>
              <div>
                <div class="timeline-item__title">AI & Media Projects</div>
                <div class="timeline-item__desc">Exploring AI-powered content, automation, and digital storytelling systems.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
              <div class="timeline-item__year">2025</div>
              <div>
                <div class="timeline-item__title">International Student Recruitment</div>
                <div class="timeline-item__desc">Led digital marketing strategy for international education recruitment campaigns.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
              <div class="timeline-item__year">2023</div>
              <div>
                <div class="timeline-item__title">ChefDaddy Cuisine</div>
                <div class="timeline-item__desc">Founded and operated a culinary brand using digital systems for growth and retention.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-item">
              <div class="timeline-item__year">2018</div>
              <div>
                <div class="timeline-item__title">Founded Correct Marketing NG</div>
                <div class="timeline-item__desc">Built a performance-driven digital marketing agency focused on revenue systems for Nigerian businesses.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-section">
    <div class="cta-section__bg"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-section__content">
        <div class="label" style="justify-content:center;">Next Step</div>
        <h2 class="display-md" style="color:var(--paper); margin-bottom:16px;">Ready to Build Something That Works?</h2>
        <p>I keep my client roster tight. If you're serious about revenue, let's explore if we're a fit.</p>
        <div class="cta-section__btns">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact"><span>→ Start a Conversation</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/services"><span>View Services</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
